---
// Home hero: Federico's opening (commit 5401a7d), the hook over the "Rientro" film, with the site
// header floating over it (SiteHeader `overlay`). The app follows in the next section (HouseStory).
// Texts: `cover.map.payoff`, `cover.map.stop4`, `cta.primary`.
// The film (public/assets/video/, AI-generated scenes, so labelled "Scene dimostrative") shows a
// return home in seven scenes: dark house, path lights following him, the door camera recognising
// him, fingerprint keypad and the door opening, living room lights / wall panel / curtains, the
// armchair and whiskey with the lights dimmed from the app's slider, the lit house from outside.
// ~32 s loop with slow crossfades, action kept centre-right because the scrim darkens the left
// half. opening-video.js loads it after the page, keeps only the poster with
// prefers-reduced-motion or Save-Data and drives the pause button.
// Sources and cut: ~/Desktop/reference_video/v2/ (STORYBOARD.md, build.sh) on the owner's machine.
import '../styles/opening.css';
---
<div class="frame">
  <div class="site">
    <div class="open" id="top" data-hv-root>
      <div class="open__media" aria-hidden="true">
        <video class="open__video" data-hv-video muted loop playsinline preload="none"
          poster="/assets/video/rientro-poster.jpg" width="1920" height="1080"
          data-src-large="/assets/video/rientro-1080.mp4" data-src-small="/assets/video/rientro-720.mp4"></video>
      </div>
      <div class="hook">
        <h1 class="w-display-xxl"><span class="ln"><span>The Art</span></span><span class="ln"><span>of Living</span></span><span class="ln"><span class="w-accent">Smart.</span></span></h1>
        <p class="sub w-subtitle">Goditi l'esperienza, al resto pensiamo noi.</p>
        <div class="hook__actions">
          <a class="w-cta w-button" href="#contatti">Richiedi una consulenza</a>
          <a class="hook__more" href="#funzioni">Scopri le funzioni<span aria-hidden="true"></span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
      <a class="open__cue" href="#app" aria-label="Scorri per scoprire Dymora"><span></span></a>
      <div class="open__foot">
        <p class="open__note">Scene dimostrative</p>
        <button class="open__pause" type="button" data-hv-pause aria-pressed="false" aria-label="Metti in pausa il video" hidden>
          <span class="open__pause-icon" aria-hidden="true"></span>
        </button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
